{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "5_01_044_22",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:026994457420d6c715f37f22fc353a6c22019e8794d3a0acfcadbaa5423d89dc",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_a:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:783a7ebb03e61eaf4f183ca11d2865942b45078da14cbab410df276d9780945c",
      "text": "这玩意是……情人节的巧克力吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:279dc0d08bb81116e18e76826fd88d6408e4c607a59e92618f2b36551e366055",
      "text": "谢啦。\n是考虑到了我的喜好才特意准备的吧？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_a:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:815703fc2cfdae30be215bf72add6bfa7cf8714eae150e737c4df23c1f0c055e",
      "text": "这盒巧克力，就留到今天的工作开始前享用吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d5839c702f22a5e826ce87a9c2431b23e124641d0f478ce5cd3c77b3529d5de9",
      "text": "那么，我差不多该去上训练课了。\n……啊，对了对了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4560b2868a7d964e95b44bd74e43257f1d6b1c4f4ace7318092af405ebc2223a",
      "text": "下个月的回礼就敬请期待吧。\n回头见啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:566d97ffc58c32ec2e3c7e33ffe4f77cbce2efc5367605160ced1e52ebf671f0",
      "text": "这是情人节的巧克力吗。哈哈，\n虽然隐隐有这种预感，但收到还是挺让人高兴的呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9862f3a80135441c37b112e048703b996ad8bd445a5dcdaa2a6fa6c6a240ebfd",
      "text": "你平时明明也挺忙的，\n亏你能抽得出时间准备呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000020:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:49d48a061e6989e12da7029b38733a96cc2332e61d766c2a49fa82ab82069850",
      "text": "靠着Passion准备好的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000021:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dff6442fc98a64418fe6e120ab29bd6633a9ba2b8b5f2244de0c1724f9d9a513",
      "text": "这种程度根本算不上什么！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de18c6f08f98e403d6d6d725dd4beb21f913c977f5cb4a707492143f73803771",
      "text": "是吗。你那份直率和\n细心体贴，还真叫人佩服呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3e1f408faffd8c63512f0ff8049ab1344eb5921706d868e11b31857355a3ed94",
      "text": "谢啦，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48fd7af8bd685c407e4733ca7c88761ca45cacbc471722172f297e54b42079a7",
      "text": "你不管面对什么事都全心投入的姿态，\n总是让我深感惊叹。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3170927b5a88f3857a3e958a24f546157a10fa2d43b2f2f05973faf3387b28b",
      "text": "你对待我们也是这副全心以对的态度吧？\n这份心意我也能从这盒巧克力里真切地感受到哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8165700ffc2368caf04e7708f35a2b109ba32001693703ca2766b1b77b02de0d",
      "text": "这个我就心怀感激地收下了。\n……啊，对了。我也得准备谢礼才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:5_01_044_22:5_01_044_22_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f900d3761f2abf4ce8ef97e7b053b9a777309e8971fee5e93b31c2dedc971215",
      "text": "嘛，白色情人节就敬请期待吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
